  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Rights in Action&quot; is a human rights initiative designed to deliver tangible change for marginalized communities in Jordan. Through service provision, policy advocacy, and community mobilization, the project breaks down systemic barriers and empowers vulnerable groups to live with dignity and equality.</narrative>
  </description>
